<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Cyber Hacking Lab</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #0a0f0d;
            color: #e8f5e9;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        header {
            background: #050806;
            padding: 20px 8%;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #1f3d2a;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .logo {
            color: #39ff88;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        nav a {
            color: #ddd;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 20px;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #39ff88;
        }

        .hero {
            min-height: 75vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 60px 8%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #12301e, #050806 65%);
        }

        .hero-content {
            max-width: 750px;
        }

        .tag {
            color: #39ff88;
            font-family: monospace;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 58px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        h1 span {
            color: #39ff88;
        }

        .hero p {
            color: #b7c8bc;
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #39ff88;
            color: #061008;
            padding: 13px 24px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        section {
            padding: 70px 8%;
        }

        section h2 {
            font-size: 34px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .subtitle {
            color: #9eafa4;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
        }

        .cards {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .card {
            background: #101813;
            border: 1px solid #1f3d2a;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 25px;
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: #39ff88;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .card p {
            color: #b7c8bc;
        }

        .terminal {
            background: #020403;
            border: 1px solid #1f3d2a;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 25px;
            font-family: monospace;
            color: #39ff88;
            overflow-x: auto;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
            background: #050806;
            color: #7f9085;
            border-top: 1px solid #1f3d2a;
        }

        @media (max-width: 700px) {
            header {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 15px;
            }

            nav a {
                margin: 0 7px;
            }

            h1 {
                font-size: 40px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <div class="logo">&lt;/&gt; CYBER LAB</div>

    <nav>
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#topics">Topics</a>
        <a href="#labs">Labs</a>
    </nav>
</header>

<section class="hero" id="home">
    <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="tag">> ACCESSING CYBERSECURITY LAB...</div>

        <h1>Learn. Test. <span>Secure.</span></h1>

        <p>
            A cybersecurity learning environment for exploring ethical
            hacking, penetration testing, network security and defensive
            security techniques.
        </p>

        <a href="#topics" class="button">Explore the Lab</a>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="topics">
    <h2>Cybersecurity Topics</h2>
    <p class="subtitle">
        Build your knowledge through practical and responsible security learning.
    </p>

    <div class="cards">

        <div class="card">
            <h3>🛡 Ethical Hacking</h3>
            <p>
                Learn how authorized security testing helps identify and
                fix weaknesses in systems.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>🌐 Network Security</h3>
            <p>
                Understand networks, protocols, firewalls and common
                security weaknesses.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>🔐 Password Security</h3>
            <p>
                Learn about strong passwords, authentication and
                responsible password auditing.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>💻 Linux Security</h3>
            <p>
                Explore Linux commands, permissions, processes and
                defensive security techniques.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

<section id="labs">
    <h2>Security Lab</h2>
    <p class="subtitle">
        Practice only in systems you own or have explicit permission to test.
    </p>

    <div class="terminal">
        $ whoami<br>
        cyber-student<br><br>

        $ mission<br>
        Learn cybersecurity responsibly.<br><br>

        $ status<br>
        LAB ONLINE ✓
    </div>
</section>

<footer>
    © 2026 Cyber Hacking Lab | Ethical Cybersecurity Learning
</footer>

</body>
</html>
